  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Survivors new start</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When families have spent six months in one of our safe houses having fled Domestic Abuse they are then ready to begin new lives with their children. If they are lucky they will be offered accommodation close to the house so that they can continue to grow their support network and their children can continue at the same school and maintain friendships etc. When they leave us they then need everything to start building their new home.  Furniture, white goods and soft furnishings,</narrative>
  </description>
